          "type": "text",
          "id": "fSMnn",
          "name": "• Use Piper's tokens and",
          "fill": "$mut",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Use Piper's tokens and fonts (Inter, JetBrains Mono, the dark palette of piper/web/app.css). Light theme follows the GUI's light tokens.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p5G2nw",
          "name": "• Wizard (D1–D5): left r",
          "fill": "$mut",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Wizard (D1–D5): left rail with 4 steps; one screen per step; Continue only after a check finished; nothing installed before Continue.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Wofw1",
          "name": "• D1 rows: ok / will ins",
          "fill": "$mut",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• D1 rows: ok / will install / running / problem. Docker is only checked; installing a runtime is the last-resort option in D4.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "A9NNW",
          "name": "• D2 shows only when a c",
          "fill": "$mut",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• D2 shows only when a compatible extension is found and not yet trusted. Registered extensions preselect 'Load it'; scan results preselect 'Not now'.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
